    <fields>
        <fullName>Roofing_Stage__c</fullName>
        <description>The Roofing module's OWN pre-project pipeline on the customer hub (mirror of Service_Stage__c, D-075). Stage__c stays the solar sales pipeline; Status__c stays the hub lifecycle. Set to New by POST /roofing/customers on a new or untracked customer, never overwriting an existing stage. Project Created is stamped when a Sundial_Roofing__c is created from the customer.</description>
